.TH geectl-checkout-pr 1  "geectl-checkout-pr 0.3.0" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-checkout\-pr \- Check out a Gitea pull request into a git working copy, under the current directory: the pull request\*(Aqs head repo at its head branch, into `<owner>/<repo>/`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl checkout\-pr\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check out a Gitea pull request into a git working copy, under the current directory: the pull request\*(Aqs head repo at its head branch, into `<owner>/<repo>/`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
The pull\-request handle: `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0
